---
layout: base.njk
title: "Daily operator source checks"
description: "Numeric offers, published policies and collection status for ten operators. Reviewed values remain separate from automated claims and measured outcomes."
permalink: "/updates/"
publishedAt: "2026-09-10"
updatedAt: "2026-09-11"
jsonld:
  "@context": "https://schema.org"
  "@type": "CollectionPage"
  name: "Daily operator source checks"
  url: "https://socialcasinoindex.com/updates/"
---
<main><article class="wrap numeric-monitor">
  <nav class="crumbs" aria-label="Breadcrumb"><ol><li><a href="/">Home</a></li><li>Daily checks</li></ol></nav>
  <h1>Daily operator source checks</h1>
  <p>Operator-published amounts, not measured payouts or eligibility confirmation. Automated claims are unreviewed. Conflicting terms remain unresolved.</p>
  <p id="refresh-warning" role="status" data-last-refresh="{{ numeric.lastSuccessfulRefresh | escape }}"{% if not refreshStale %} hidden{% endif %}><strong>Refresh overdue:</strong> no successful public refresh in the last 36 hours. Retained values may be out of date.</p>
  {% if numeric.runId %}
  <p><strong>Last public refresh:</strong> <time datetime="{{ numeric.lastSuccessfulRefresh | escape }}">{{ numeric.lastSuccessfulRefresh | escape }}</time></p>
  <p><a href="/updates/numeric.json">Numeric JSON</a> &middot; <a href="/updates/data.json">Observations JSON</a>{% if monitor.summary.githubRunUrl %} &middot; <a href="{{ monitor.summary.githubRunUrl | escape }}" rel="noopener">Production run</a>{% endif %}</p>
  {% for operator in numericRows %}
  <section id="{{ operator.slug | escape }}">
    <h2><a href="/redemption-times/{{ operator.slug | escape }}/">{{ operator.name | escape }}</a></h2>
    <p><strong>{{ operator.collectionStatus | escape }}</strong>: {{ operator.readablePages }}/{{ operator.attemptedPages }} sources readable. Extraction: {{ operator.extractionStatus | escape }}.</p>
    <p>Attempt: {{ operator.lastAttempt | escape }}. Last readable capture: {{ operator.lastSuccessfulCapture | default("Unknown", true) | escape }}.<br>{{ operator.changeStatus | escape }}.</p>
    {% if operator.productMode == "entertainment_only" %}<p><strong>Entertainment-only product. Coins are not redeemable SC.</strong></p>{% endif %}
    {% if operator.records.length %}
    <div class="numeric-table-scroll" tabindex="0" role="region" aria-label="{{ operator.name | escape }} numeric claims">
      <table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Claim</th><th scope="col">Published value</th><th scope="col">Scope and conditions</th><th scope="col">Review and evidence</th></tr></thead>
      <tbody>{% for record in operator.records %}
        <tr><th scope="row">{{ record.label | escape }}</th><td>{{ record.valueText | escape }}</td><td>{{ record.scopeText | escape }}</td>
        <td><strong>{{ record.reviewLabel | escape }}</strong><br>{{ record.freshnessLabel | escape }}<br>
          {% if record.sourceUrl %}<a href="{{ record.sourceUrl | escape }}" rel="noopener">Operator source</a><br>{% endif %}
          Captured: {{ record.capturedAt | default("Unknown", true) | escape }}
          {% if record.lastConfirmedAt %}<br>Confirmed: {{ record.lastConfirmedAt | escape }}{% endif %}
        </td></tr>
      {% endfor %}</tbody></table>
    </div>
    {% else %}<p>Numeric values: unknown.</p>{% endif %}
    {% if operator.unknowns.length %}<p>Unknown: {{ operator.unknowns | join("; ") | escape }}.</p>{% endif %}
    <details><summary>Source coverage</summary><ul>{% for source in operator.coverage %}<li><a href="{{ source.url | escape }}" rel="noopener">{{ source.id | escape }}</a>: {{ source.status | escape }}; purpose: {{ source.purpose | escape }}{% if source.capturedAt %}; {{ source.capturedAt | escape }}{% endif %}</li>{% endfor %}</ul></details>
  </section>
  {% endfor %}
  {% else %}<p>The first numeric publication has not completed.</p>{% endif %}
</article></main>
<style>
.numeric-monitor section{padding:1.5rem 0;border-top:1px solid #cbd5e1}
.numeric-monitor h2{font-size:1.4rem}
.numeric-table-scroll{overflow-x:auto;max-width:100%}
.numeric-monitor table{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:.875rem}
.numeric-monitor th,.numeric-monitor td{text-align:left;vertical-align:top;padding:.65rem;border-bottom:1px solid #d1d5db;min-width:9rem;overflow-wrap:anywhere}
.numeric-monitor td:nth-child(3){min-width:15rem}
.numeric-monitor th{font-weight:600}
.numeric-monitor #refresh-warning{padding:1rem;border-left:4px solid #b91c1c;background:#fef2f2;color:#7f1d1d}
.numeric-monitor p,.numeric-monitor li{overflow-wrap:anywhere}
</style>
<script src="/assets/monitor-freshness.js" defer></script>
